<p><u><strong>Fingertip Unit</strong></u></p>

<p>1 FTU = 0.5g = Amount that can be squeezed from the fingertip to the first crease of the finger</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Enough to cover 2 hands (one side) worth of skin</p>

<p>Face and neck = 2.5 FTU</p>

<p>Trunk (front or back) = 7 FTU</p>

<p>Arm = 3 FTU</p>

<p>Leg = 6 FTU</p>

<p>Foot = 2 FTU</p>

